          "turn_index": 0,
          "reply_to": null,
          "msg_uid": "42:160407",
          "body": "（手里捏着半截废木料，眼睛却瞟着评委席）兰姐，你说我这小玩意儿要是拿不了名次，回头给桂婶当柴火烧，她能不能少念叨我两句？",
          "ctx": {
            "initiator": "P014",
            "mood": "紧绷",
            "need": {
              "leisure": 0
            },
            "relation": 0,
            "topic": "contest",
            "trigger": "contest"
          }
        },
        {
          "seq": 160854,
          "round": 79,
          "type": "MSG_GROUP",
          "from": "P002",
          "to": null,
          "group_id": "place:plaza",
          "turn_index": 1,
          "reply_to": "42:160407",
          "msg_uid": "42:160854",
          "body": "（头也不抬，用刨子推过木料）名次是别人的事。活儿细不细，你自己知道。",
          "ctx": {
            "initiator": "P014",
            "mood": "紧绷",
            "need": {
              "leisure": 0
            },
            "relation": 8,
            "topic": "contest",
            "trigger": "reply"
          }
        },
        {
          "seq": 160915,
          "round": 79,
          "type": "MSG_GROUP",
          "from": "P003",
          "to": null,
          "group_id": "place:plaza",
          "turn_index": 1,
          "reply_to": "42:160407",
          "msg_uid": "42:160915",
          "body": "（低头搓着衣角）巧儿，别光想着名次……桂婶那边，我帮你说说。",
          "ctx": {
            "initiator": "P014",
            "mood": "紧绷",
            "need": {
              "leisure": 0
            },
            "relation": 11,
            "topic": "contest",
            "trigger": "reply"
          }
        },
        {
          "seq": 161057,
          "round": 79,
          "type": "MSG_GROUP",
          "from": "P005",
          "to": null,
          "group_id": "place:plaza",
          "turn_index": 1,
          "reply_to": "42:160407",
          "msg_uid": "42:161057",
          "body": "（用镊子夹着棉球，头也没抬）巧儿，你这心思就没在木头上。名次是别人的事，手艺才是自己的。桂婶念叨你，是怕你糟蹋东西——你把这半截料子雕出个样子来，比什么名次都强。",
          "ctx": {
            "initiator": "P014",
            "mood": "紧绷",
            "need": {
              "leisure": 0
            },
            "relation": 1,
            "topic": "contest",
            "trigger": "reply"
          }
        },
        {
          "seq": 161666,
          "round": 79,
          "type": "MSG_GROUP",
          "from": "P012",
          "to": null,
          "group_id": "place:plaza",
          "turn_index": 1,
          "reply_to": "42:160407",
          "msg_uid": "42:161666",
          "body": "（笑着拍了下巧儿的胳膊）哎哟，你这孩子，说什么呢！桂婶我啥时候念叨过你啦？你那手艺，镇上谁不夸？烧火？我可舍不得！",
          "ctx": {
            "initiator": "P014",
            "mood": "紧绷",
            "need": {
              "leisure": 0
            },
            "relation": 1,
            "topic": "contest",
            "trigger": "reply"
          }
        },
        {
          "seq": 161982,
          "round": 79,
          "type": "MSG_GROUP",
          "from": "P016",
          "to": null,
          "group_id": "place:plaza",
          "turn_index": 1,
          "reply_to": "42:160407",
          "msg_uid": "42:161982",
          "body": "（把手里那串铜钱往摊上一搁，抬眼扫了扫巧儿那半截木料）念叨是躲不掉的，可你这手艺，烧了可惜。名次那玩意儿，评委眼一花就没了，货好不好，我一眼就看得出来——你这活儿，有心思在里头。",
          "ctx": {
            "initiator": "P014",
            "mood": "紧绷",
            "need": {
              "leisure": 0
            },
            "relation": 18,
            "topic": "contest",
            "trigger": "reply"
          }
        },
        {
          "seq": 184186,
          "round": 81,
          "type": "MSG_GROUP",
          "from": "P014",
          "to": null,
          "group_id": "place:plaza",
          "turn_index": 2,
          "reply_to": "42:161982",
          "msg_uid": "42:184186",
          "body": "（把刻刀往木料上一搁，冲兰姐挤挤眼）兰姐这话我爱听——那评委要是眼花了，你替我瞪他们去？",
          "ctx": {
            "initiator": "P014",
            "mood": "紧绷",
            "need": {
              "leisure": 0
            },
            "relation": 11,
